{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0572_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0572_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8585709f5e21e6964bf669cc85b5775a31d368178cc50d39802af35ec702427d", "ja": "（百合子は、自分が演じた役が出ている昔話を\n読み直しているらしいのだが……何やら表情が険しい）", "zh": "（百合子似乎正在重读那个有她出演角色的童话故事……可她的表情不知为何很严肃。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0572_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0572_1001_026yur", "source_sha256": "37fdcbe88ecec72d39ef1e80b649b044c118540a73e50847b1b9acdc03116950", "ja": "やっぱり、あの時の私、\nお話と一緒の状態になってたんですよね……。", "zh": "果然，那个时候的我，\n变成了和故事里一样的状态啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0572_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0572_1002_026yur", "source_sha256": "8f4c9cf8a1731fc71927b7a55b31de3cbc4672c2cce6709ca02f574b919dff36", "ja": "転ぶ演技までは、完璧にできたのに、\n恥ずかしいところを見られちゃって……うぅ。", "zh": "明明连摔倒的演技都完美完成了，却被人看到了丢脸的样子……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0572_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0572_1003_p", "source_sha256": "d7ab94a08275733568acae7a57cbe36da76613329bb293203284f443a097081a", "ja": "ま、まあ。ちょっとしたハプニングだったけど\n無事に撮影も終わったし、よかったじゃないか！", "zh": "总、总之，虽然发生了点小意外，\n但拍摄也顺利结束了，这不是挺好的吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0572_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0572_1004_026yur", "source_sha256": "5395a14ae9d885aa6d74ad3a8198f7ac90d2b05bf04c868bb36137158ebc88e5", "ja": "いえ！　この昔話によると、私の演じた役には、\n更に不幸な出来事が起こるみたいで……。", "zh": "不！根据这个民间故事，我演的那个角色，\n接下来似乎还会遇到更不幸的遭遇……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0572_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0572_1005_026yur", "source_sha256": "f0fbb2ad871480eac498d2f6f9c409167d17aac428025176a807bf260fd11cb7", "ja": "もしかしたら私も、\nとんでもない災難に遭ってしまうのでは……！？", "zh": "说不定我也会遭遇什么不得了的灾难……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0572_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0572_1006_p", "source_sha256": "12b13f3193b8ce84ba5336d6f77ab649538ad321be4d80f79ebdcb4b05b62d73", "ja": "考えすぎだと思うけど……。気を引き締めておいて\n損はないからな。俺もいろいろ注意しておくよ。", "zh": "我觉得你是想太多了……不过，保持警惕总没有坏处。我也会多加注意的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0572_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0572_1007_026yur", "source_sha256": "beaf6efd6167db8bd765560cbda0ebe7b2910ad4a07934002b57173367df9d82", "ja": "そうですね。今回は、恥ずかしいだけで済みました\nけど……うっかりケガをしちゃったら大変です。", "zh": "是啊。这次只是觉得难为情就算了，\n但要是不小心受了伤，可就糟糕了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0572_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0572_1008_026yur", "source_sha256": "5cf9dee4e96b69075da0f46e87bd966ff48ec398cb37f709e92e8e21281bb14d", "ja": "何事も、焦らず、慎重に……！　物語から\n学んだことを活かせるように、私も気をつけます！", "zh": "无论做什么，都不能着急，要慎重……！我也会多加注意，争取把从故事中学到的东西运用起来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
